error[algo/bound-dimension-mismatch]: `y` is read at dimension `nat` but bound at dimension `nat*`
  ┌─ ../../../../testdata/spec/neg/algo/dataflow-read-iterated-binding-in-premise.watsup:7:9
  │
6 │   -- (if y = $(x + 1))*
  │          - bound here
7 │   -- if y = 3
  │         ^ `y` is read here
